इति मां योऽभिजानाति कर्मभिर्न स बध्यते ॥ १४ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":1373,\"bb\":1222,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/4/14/b1222/\",\"body_value\":\"na māṁ karmāṇi limpanti
na me karma-phale spṛhā
