karmabhir na sa badhyate\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":1374,\"bb\":1223,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/4/14/b1223/\",\"shadow_value\":\"na – never; mām – Me; karmāṇi – all kinds of work; limpanti – do affect; na – nor; me – My; karma-phale – in fruitive action; spṛhā – aspiration; iti – thus; mām – Me; yaḥ – one who; abhijānāti – does know; karmabhiḥ – by the reaction of such work; na – never; saḥ – he; badhyate – becomes entangled.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"na\",\"translation\":\"never\"},{\"word\":\"mām\",\"translation\":\"Me\"},{\"word\":\"karmāṇi\",\"translation\":\"all kinds of work\"},{\"word\":\"limpanti\",\"translation\":\"do affect\"},{\"word\":\"na\",\"translation\":\"nor\"},{\"word\":\"me\",\"translation\":\"My\"},{\"word\":\"karma-phale\",\"translation\":\"in fruitive action\"},{\"word\":\"spṛhā\",\"translation\":\"aspiration\"},{\"word\":\"iti\",\"translation\":\"thus\"},{\"word\":\"mām\",\"translation\":\"Me\"},{\"word\":\"yaḥ\",\"translation\":\"one who\"},{\"word\":\"abhijānāti\",\"translation\":\"does know\"},{\"word\":\"karmabhiḥ\",\"translation\":\"by the reaction of such work\"},{\"word\":\"na\",\"translation\":\"never\"},{\"word\":\"saḥ\",\"translation\":\"he\"},{\"word\":\"badhyate\",\"translation\":\"becomes entangled\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":1375,\"bb\":1224,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/4/14/b1224/\",\"body_value\":\"There is no work that affects Me; nor do I aspire for the fruits of action. One who understands this truth about Me also does not become entangled in the fruitive reactions of work.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":1376,\"bb\":1225,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg